w location <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy_backward</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a range of elements in backwards order <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reverse_copy</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a copy of a range that is reversed <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy_n</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a number of elements to a new location <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fill</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns a range of elements a certain value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>remove_copy</span><span>remove_copy_if</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a range of elements omitting those that satisfy specific criteria <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementations","id":"Possible_implementations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/ranges","title":"Extensions for ranges"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::ranges::